	order_index: 9
	parent: "2F1A384416C57A23"
	progression_mode: "flexible"
	quest_links: [ ]
	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Brutality 不是一个带有附加内容的武器模组。它更像是六个模组拼凑在一起，而武器反而是人们最后注意到的部分。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它为游戏添加了一整套战斗属性表：</grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>暴击几率</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、</grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>暴击伤害</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、</grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>致命性</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、</grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>护甲穿透</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、</grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>韧性</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、</grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>闪避几率</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、</grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>生命偷取</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、</grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>全能吸血</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，以及九个独立的魔法学派等级。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在本整合包中，它与 Terramity 直接相连。一半配方消耗 Terramity 金属，另一半消耗 Terramity 首领掉落物。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>脊柱沿线的各个系统，按顺序排列</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"1. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>Rage</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，你需要解锁的第二条资源条。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"2. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>海豹</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，永久属性升级，用铁砧锻造装备。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"3. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>脚链</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，一个额外的 Curios 物品栏位。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"4. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>魔法</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，九个学派各有自己的典籍和法力。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"5. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>Hearts</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>, 另一个插槽，用来让你保持生命。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"6. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>Gastronomy</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，既真实又有趣，而且还能用得上。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"7. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>护身符、罪孽、数学和办公设备。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"8. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>武器，全部五十件。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"{ \"text\": \"Back to Terramity\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"#8FCB3F\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"2F1A384416C57A23\" } }"
				"{ \"text\": \"Lethality, the sword half of this pair\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"#A31419\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"20FAEEFB40B0A5B7\" } }"
			]
