				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>骄傲</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>: 生命值越满，伤害越高。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>贪婪</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>: </grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>7格内每只生物的伤害增加2%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，上限为</grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>50%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>嫉妒</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>: 获得你与最近玩家之间一半的生命值差。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>暴食</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>: 吸收你杀死的东西的灵魂以获得额外属性。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>Sloth</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>: 近战命中会施加虚弱 I、缓慢 I 和挖掘疲劳 I，持续一秒。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>愤怒</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>: 提供怒气条访问权限。</grad></shadow>"
