		{
			dependencies: ["498B38B5449ADEA3"]
			description: [
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>Sine Function</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>: 攻击伤害遵循 sin(time x 0.1) x 5 + 2.5 的规律变化。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>余弦函数</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>: 攻击速度遵循 cos(时间 x 0.1) x 0.25 + 0.125。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>指数函数</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>: 伤害为 (1 + 连击数 x 0.01) 的幂，连击上限为 </grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>15</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 次。切换目标或等待 5 秒会重置连击数。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>Sum</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>: 储存所受伤害的一半，每次最多 </grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>10</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，上限为 </grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>150</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，然后将其全部添加到你的下一次攻击中。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>Pi</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>: 三个π符号以每秒π圈的速度围绕你旋转，击中时造成π点伤害。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>Addition</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>, </grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>Subtraction</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>, </grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>Multiplication</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>, </grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>Division</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>: 减法会削减一部分受到的伤害，除法则将其除以 1.1。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>科学计算器</grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>能让你使用各种函数和常数。它自带 64KB 的 RAM。</grad></shadow>"
			]
