				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>靶子方块</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>: </grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>+10%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 幸运度每级提升暴击率。此整合包中由靶子、反物质和一颗 </grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>幸运骰子</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 制成。"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>Lucky Insoles</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>: </grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>+20 percent</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 双脚着地时的暴击几率。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>Fuzzy Dice</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>: 有几率使暴击伤害翻倍，达到 </grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>2倍</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 的暴击伤害。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>黑物质项链</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>: </grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>+2%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 暴击率，以及每点护甲-1%</grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8> 暴击伤害。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>拳套护具</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>：连续近战攻击可获得 3 层 </grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>精准度</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，暴击会消耗所有层数。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>骑士吊坠</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>: </grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>+5%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>生命值低于 </grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>75% 时，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>护甲穿透。</grad></shadow>"
			]
