				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>Celestial Starboard</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>: 蹲下并按住空格键向上推进。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>阴影树冠</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>: </grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>+999 气场</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，并且你会缓慢坠落。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>双曲羽毛</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>: 回复你受到的坠落伤害的 </grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>两倍</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 生命值。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>旧式断头台</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>: 执行任何攻击本应留下的效果，低于 </grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>5 颗心</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 时生效。"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>撬棍</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>: </grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>+40%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 生命值高于 </grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>90%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 的怪物伤害。 </grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>决斗手套</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>: </grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>1.5倍</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 伤害最近的生物， </grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>1.5倍</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 承受所有其他生物的伤害。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>Pincushion</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>: </grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>+1 致命性，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每支箭扎入你体内即生效。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>掠夺宝箱</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>: 近战命中会窃取敌方增益，基础为 </grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>10%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，每点幸运度额外增加 </grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>+2%。</grad></shadow>"
