		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>20 percent</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> of its damage is dealt as magic damage.</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它有多种形态，每种形态都需满足特定条件才能解锁。暗影刺客能为你提升 </grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>+40%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的移动速度，并让你能穿过生物。黑暗人则能为你回复相当于你造成的伤害的 </grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>20%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的生命值。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>基础形态会损坏你前方最多 </grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>5个方块</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 的一切，并将其向上击退。更宽的形态可触及 </grad><grad from=#C0392B to=#F2A9A0 f=0.8>7个方块</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 的距离。</grad></shadow>"
			]
